# `docs/` is a LOCAL workspace, except the auto-pipeline job example: it is a
# shipped deliverable (the `/pipeline-auto` menu points users at it and
# `job-schema.test.ts` parses it), so a clean clone / CI must have it. Git
# cannot re-include a file under an excluded DIRECTORY, hence the `docs/*`
# form plus explicit re-inclusions.
docs/*
!docs/jobs/
docs/jobs/*
!docs/jobs/example.yaml
.qoderignore
